        "content": "**Check it by hand** (terminal on the Mac)\n\n| What | Command |\n|---|---|\n| Latest backups and their status | `kubectl -n velero get backups.velero.io --sort-by=.metadata.creationTimestamp -o custom-columns=NAME:.metadata.name,PHASE:.status.phase \\| tail -5` |\n| Why a backup failed | `kubectl -n velero get backups.velero.io <backup> -o jsonpath='{.status.failureReason}'` |\n| Volumes that were not saved | `kubectl -n velero get podvolumebackups.velero.io -l velero.io/backup-name=<backup> \\| grep -v Completed` |\n| MinIO disk usage | `kubectl -n minio-system exec deploy/minio -- df -h /export` |\n| Backups on the Mac | `ls ~/velero-backups/backups/` and `du -sh ~/velero-backups` |\n| launchd agent log | `tail -20 ~/velero-auto-backup.log` |\n| Test backup (same settings as the schedule) | `velero backup create test-1 --from-schedule periodic-backup --wait` |\n"
